      "leadSummary": "**Guiding question:** How can a reproducible lattice-spacing change inform deformation without confusing it with composition or temperature? This unit connects strain interpretation and in situ measurement to an observable experiment. Every example is fictional and intentionally simplified. The sequence is designed so ",
